entityDescription:
The main objective of the Company is the search for collective interest with a view to social utility in the field of Scientific and Technical Research.
The social utility of the Company is characterized in particular by its commitment to foster permanent employment, to fight against isolation and various precariousness of research personnel.

This objective is achieved in particular through the following actions, both in France and abroad, which constitute the main activity of the company:
- Support the creation and development of economic activities of natural person entrepreneurs in the field of scientific and technical expertise, advice, engineering, R&D and the commercialization of technological innovations;
- Participate in the realization of collaborative research contracts;
- Set up and manage collaborative research or engineering projects;
- Respond to the innovation needs of socio-economic actors;
- Allow companies, from large groups to SMEs, to outsource their R&D projects and remove technological obstacles.

Within the framework of this main object, the Company will carry out the following activities:
- The realization and sale of services;
- The conduct of research programs;
- Any commercial activity, in particular the provision of engineering services for technical studies, advice, training, expertise;
- And all ancillary, related or complementary activities relating directly or indirectly to it, as well as all civil, commercial, industrial, movable, real estate, credit operations, useful directly or indirectly for the achievement of the corporate purpose.

